# The source document and anything extracted from it stay out of the repository
# unless its handling allows a copy here. The documents in documents/ are
# invented and written as Markdown.
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
icd-extract/

# Captures of real traffic. examples/ holds captures built from a document's
# example messages; first-bite's check-public-tree.sh allows them there only.
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.cap
!examples/*.pcap

# Spreadsheet lock and backup files.
~$*
.~lock.*
*.bak
.DS_Store

# The pinned first-bite checkout and its build (make first-bite, make bite).
.first-bite/

# The leak check's name list, when it is copied into a checkout. Never committed.
.leak-needles

# Secrets, when this tree is used as a repository root. They are never committed.
*.key
*.age
